        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.36,
          "end": 167.63,
          "en": "on every log item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.63,
          "end": 170.22,
          "en": "And I'll also get that from my colors constant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.22,
          "end": 174.3,
          "en": "and use the, let's say the accent 500 color,",
