        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.17000000000002,
          "end": 208.87,
          "en": "to make sure that the log items take the full width",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.87,
          "end": 211.64,
          "en": "that is made available by the parent component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.64,
          "end": 212.963,
          "en": "which is the flat list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.18,
          "end": 216.51,
          "en": "Last but not least, we can add a little shadow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 216.51,
          "end": 218.45,
          "en": "and for Android, this can be done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.45,
          "end": 221.53,
          "en": "with the elevation property, as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.53,
          "end": 225.07,
          "en": "We could set this to a value of four.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 225.07,
          "end": 227.77,
          "en": "And for iOS, we do this by adding a shadow color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 227.77,
          "end": 229.363,
          "en": "which could be black,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 230.78,
          "end": 233.51,
          "en": "and then a shadow offset",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.51,
          "end": 234.55,
          "en": "which is an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.55,
          "end": 236.85,
          "en": "with a width and a height, as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 236.85,
          "end": 240.06,
          "en": "And the width can be zero, the height can be zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 240.06,
          "end": 244.71,
          "en": "and then a shadow opacity of 0.25,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.71,
          "end": 248.31,
          "en": "and a shadow radius, let's say, of three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.31,
          "end": 250.44,
          "en": "And you can play around with these values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 250.44,
          "end": 253.713,
          "en": "to find a shadow that you like visually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 255.88,
          "end": 258.3,
          "en": "Now, with that, the styles have to be applied.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 258.3,
          "end": 261.283,
          "en": "So on that view, I add styles.listItem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 264.36,
          "end": 265.35,
          "en": "And I also wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 265.35,
          "end": 268.63,
          "en": "that I use the right font for the text in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 268.63,
          "end": 273.63,
          "en": "And therefore I'll add my itemText styling property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 273.64,
          "end": 276.14300000000003,
          "en": "where I set the font family to open-sans.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 277.4,
          "end": 280.42,
          "en": "And then this itemText styling property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 280.42,
          "end": 285.19,
          "en": "can be added as a style to both these text elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 285.19,
          "end": 287.223,
          "en": "these text components, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 288.67,
          "end": 290.61,
          "en": "Now we have the LogItem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 290.61,
          "end": 292.563,
          "en": "Now we can use it in the game screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 293.48,
          "end": 296.74,
          "en": "Here, instead of outputting this boring text here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 296.74,
          "end": 299.33,
          "en": "I wanna output my GuessLogItem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 299.33,
          "end": 301.563,
          "en": "this newly added component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 302.57,
          "end": 305.19,
          "en": "Which therefore, of course, must be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 305.19,
          "end": 307.663,
          "en": "from that file in which we created it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 309.52,
          "end": 312.77,
          "en": "And then here, we have to configure it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 312.77,
          "end": 316.37,
          "en": "We have to pass in the round number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 316.37,
          "end": 319.103,
          "en": "and we have to pass in the guess that was made.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 320.26,
          "end": 323.94,
          "en": "Now the round number can be retrieved from itemData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 323.94,
          "end": 327.83,
          "en": "because on this itemData object, besides the item itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 327.83,
          "end": 331.33,
          "en": "we also get the index of the item in the array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 331.33,
          "end": 335.67,
          "en": "And in the end, this index gives us an idea about the round.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 335.67,
          "end": 338.68,
          "en": "The index itself is not the round number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 338.68,
          "end": 340.37,
          "en": "but we know that we just need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 340.37,
          "end": 343.52,
          "en": "to take the overall length of the list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 343.52,
          "end": 345.46,
          "en": "so the number of items of the list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 345.46,
          "end": 349.26,
          "en": "minus the index, to get the round number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 349.26,
          "end": 351.45,
          "en": "We need to do this kind of calculation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 351.45,
          "end": 354.49,
          "en": "because the latest round is added at the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 354.49,
          "end": 357.55,
          "en": "So the latest round will always have an index of zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 357.55,
          "end": 359.8,
          "en": "So if we take the overall length of the list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 359.8,
          "end": 363.27,
          "en": "and we then deduct the index of the individual items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 363.27,
          "end": 364.33,
          "en": "we get the round",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 364.33,
          "end": 367.293,
          "en": "in which this item was added to the overall list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 368.29,
          "end": 370.41,
          "en": "Now to get this listItem length,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 370.41,
          "end": 372.28,
          "en": "we can add a regular constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 372.28,
          "end": 374.08,
          "en": "anywhere in this component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 374.08,
          "end": 376.94,
          "en": "before the JSX code is returned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 376.94,
          "end": 380.74,
          "en": "And here we get the guessRoundsListLength",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 380.74,
          "end": 385.21,
          "en": "by simply using guessRounds.length.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 385.21,
          "end": 386.64,
          "en": "So this is recalculated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 386.64,
          "end": 389.35,
          "en": "every time the component is reevaluated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 389.35,
          "end": 392.21,
          "en": "which will happen whenever a new round is added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 392.21,
          "end": 393.89,
          "en": "And then we can use this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 396.03,
          "end": 399.83299999999997,
          "en": "to deduct itemData.index from it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 401.07,
          "end": 403.57,
          "en": "And the guess itself, of course, is itemData.item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 405.49,
          "end": 408.34000000000003,
          "en": "So the number value itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 408.34000000000003,
          "end": 411.43,
          "en": "This is how we can deduct the round number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 411.43,
          "end": 414.37,
          "en": "and then the value for the round itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 414.37,
          "end": 416.163,
          "en": "the number that was guessed.",
          "zh": ""
